# MTO Index Schema

## Entry

- id: string
- offset: u64
- length: u32
- dtype: f16 | f32 | bf16 | i8 | u8
- device: cpu | gpu | npu

## Notes

- Entries are deterministic and ordered.
- Offsets must be aligned to shard boundary.
